">It</span> <span begin="5:03.440" end="5:03.660">will</span> <span begin="5:03.660" end="5:04.185">all</span> <span begin="5:04.185" end="5:04.380">be</span> <span begin="5:04.380" end="5:04.620">o</span><span begin="5:04.620" end="5:04.957">kay</span> <span begin="5:04.957" end="5:05.075">in</span> <span begin="5:05.075" end="5:05.165">the</span> <span begin="5:05.165" end="5:05.604">end</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所有长夜终将退潮</span></p></div></body></tt>